Phase A did not begin producing scientific draw records.

The first GPU invocation failed while constructing fixed spectral weights with
`torch.special.ndtri` on cuda:3. PyTorch attempted NVRTC compilation and the
host CUDA 13 installation lacked `libnvrtc-builtins.so.13.0`. No alternate GPU
or dtype was used. The fixed rank weights are independent of data and costs, so
their float64 closed-form construction was moved to CPU with an explicit copy
to physical GPU 3 and runner-side caching. A physical-GPU-3 regression test was
added before retrying Phase A.
